  "contentHtml": "\n<p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120317082042im_/http://img.banjig.net/d/bb/user_uploads/226598/dog-cruelty-24_5e6a6bf8.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p>Муухай санаатай хужаа нар \nхөөрхий нохойг алж байна. Яагаад гэдгийг нь мэдэхгүй зольбон нохой \nбайсан ч гэсэн арай хэтэрхий юмаа. Амьтан ш дээ энэ чинь өөрсдийг нь \nингэвэл яах болоо. Амьтан тулдаа л алуулж байна шдээ. Та бүхэн дараах \nзургуудыг хараад нохойгоо улам хайрлах байхаа. Монголд ч бас иймэрхүү \nзүйл байгааг би мэдэж байна. Хүн байсан бол ингэж алах байсан боловуу. \nҮнэхээр балмад хэрцгий хэрэг шиг санагдлаа.<!--break--></p><p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120317082042im_/http://img.banjig.net/d/bb/user_uploads/226598/dog-cruelty-13_624c6ecc.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120317082042im_/http://img.banjig.net/d/bb/user_uploads/226598/dog-cruelty-18_aea10b1a.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120317082042im_/http://img.banjig.net/d/bb/user_uploads/226598/dog-cruelty-20_fd64ae9c.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120317082042im_/http://img.banjig.net/d/bb/user_uploads/226598/dog-cruelty-19_c6b12bd9.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120317082042im_/http://img.banjig.net/d/bb/user_uploads/226598/dog-cruelty-15_fb2481da.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120317082042im_/http://img.banjig.net/d/bb/user_uploads/226598/dog-cruelty-14_63624e13.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120317082042im_/http://img.banjig.net/d/bb/user_uploads/226598/dog-cruelty-16_eab6248f.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120317082042im_/http://img.banjig.net/d/bb/